{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0218_story_035hin01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_035hin01_title", "source_sha256": "b12d293bcb2a92d16140ff2a9412938b2ad60c4a9382fb18057377dc018ae70d", "ja": "ひなたとおでかけ1", "zh": "与日向一同出游1", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0218_story_035hin01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_035hin01_synopsis", "source_sha256": "a9d8ee25c3e32bfc640b3cd219f8500d73b5cde7f54996cfdd79e37315ff625a", "ja": "ひなたとおでかけした一幕です。", "zh": "和日向一起外出的片段。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0218_story_035hin01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_035hin01_1000_p", "source_sha256": "02b4b54607e5ff8db5096751f9d0786bcd1e5087e9e5630f36be3eb7b896fcea", "ja": "（風情溢れる銀山温泉で、ひなたのミニライブが\n行われた。地元の人がたくさん観に来てくれたぞ！）", "zh": "（在风情万种的银山温泉举办了日向的迷你演唱会。好多当地人都来观看了！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0218_story_035hin01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_035hin01_1001_035hin", "source_sha256": "9df6a038511041f03fbacc1eb64fe89a11cf5fd931a7967fdd80ee9c97b4c640", "ja": "{$P$}、お疲れさんです。\nミニライブ、どうだっただろか？", "zh": "{$P$}，辛苦了。\n迷你演唱会，感觉怎么样呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0218_story_035hin01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_035hin01_1002_p", "source_sha256": "e67bac842086afe912590abdfd3e420aa0ca7aebef439fcaea5511f5c2e95d57", "ja": "ああ、良かったぞ！　お客さんもひなたのこと、\n「めんこい、めんこい」って褒めてたな。", "zh": "啊，很棒啊！观众也一直夸日向，说她“可爱，可爱”的呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0218_story_035hin01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_035hin01_1003_035hin", "source_sha256": "ed34a2f0d3d919f2b38333b60bc057be7abd7ed407ec8781838c6f6cbebd2927", "ja": "めんこい？　ありゃ、たまげたべさ。\n山形でも、「めんこい」って言葉を使うんだねぇ。", "zh": "可爱？哎呀，吓我一跳。\n山形也会用“可爱”这个词呀。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0218_story_035hin01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_035hin01_1004_035hin", "source_sha256": "58882cdb11e9401f4dab8ee9c5f6c3e8e139b19b8c0840be3f9e5f3b0d1135e2", "ja": "なんだかうれしいねぇ。\n言葉が似てると、親近感が湧くべさ。", "zh": "总觉得很开心呢。\n用词相似的话，就会产生亲切感嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0218_story_035hin01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_035hin01_1005_p", "source_sha256": "ec5be084a39415c1cf29d98a5d365c9c93e28d725706e90d79461237e6066320", "ja": "そういえばライブ後に、皆が「おしょうしなっし」\nって言ってたな……あれは、どういう意味なんだろう？", "zh": "说起来，演唱会结束后，大家好像都说着“おしょうしなっし”呢……\n那到底是什么意思呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0218_story_035hin01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_035hin01_1006_035hin", "source_sha256": "aea597d1ff38fbd15a6cd247c3ce9d97a5cd2924469cb0e2432c48877cc8cade", "ja": "それは、あたしも知らない言葉だねえ。おしょう……\nどこかの、和尚さんが来てたんだろか？", "zh": "那也是我不知道的说法呢。和尚……难道是有哪里的和尚来过吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0218_story_035hin01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_035hin01_1007_p", "source_sha256": "2858eb9612815f047a85af76354d7ad6eb7d26560a5602bcaf1f74a5bdd83d3d", "ja": "ちょっと調べてみるか……へぇ、米沢弁で\n「ありがとう」って意味みたいだ。", "zh": "稍微查一下吧……诶，好像是米泽方言里“谢谢”的意思。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0218_story_035hin01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_035hin01_1008_035hin", "source_sha256": "0552b8daeead09812c08bd6d64568ef67ab5711206bf724ce9b67e0ce130f1af", "ja": "へえ～。したっけ、あたしも\n使ってみようかねえ。おしょうしなっし！", "zh": "哦～那我也试着用用看吧。おしょうしなっし！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0218_story_035hin01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_035hin01_1009_p", "source_sha256": "a0f786824acb668c743ab9b946bc90dcb660b1d2b17bb56e5d7a783ed2b3fe15", "ja": "はは、いいアイディアだな。\nきっとお客さん達も、喜んでくれると思うぞ！", "zh": "哈哈，这主意不错。客人们肯定也会很高兴的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
